===Etymology===
The word probably originated from the verb "blattra" meaning “talking nonsense”.

===Noun===
{{sv-noun|c}}

# {{lb|sv|often|derogatory}} A person living in a [[northern|Northern]] [[European]] country who is typically of [[Middle Eastern]] or [[North African]] [[descent]].
#  A wannabe gangster or immigrant that is not well integrated.

====Declension====
{{sv-infl-noun-c-ar|2=blatt}}

